  being hidden by later captures; see
  `tests/automated/run-gallery-screenshot-matrix.py`.

ColorPicker redisplay font-resource contract (2026-10-25)
============================================================

- Read the font selected by the live ColorPicker GC before querying its
  metrics. Passing the GC context ID as a font ID raised `BadFont` during
  redisplay on servers with independent X11 resource namespaces. The focused
  installed consumer now requests an expose and fails on any asynchronous X
  error; see `docs/color-picker-redisplay-guard.md`.

Shared redisplay font-resource contract (2026-10-25)
=====================================================

- Apply the same live-GC font lookup to InfoBar, NumberBox and Stepper. Their
  redisplay paths no longer pass a GC context ID to `XQueryFont`, eliminating
  the same `BadFont` failure from the remaining modern drawing controls; see
  their focused redisplay-guard documentation.

