- Check `XmDataFieldGetSelectionWcs` selection lengths before multiplying by `sizeof(wchar_t)`, returning cleanly when the allocation cannot be represented.
- Preserve valid wide selection contents, termination, application-lock behavior, public interfaces and native ABI. Extend the DataField wide-text regression to cover WCS selection export and document the contract in `docs/datafield-selection-wcs-bounds.md`.
- Native AArch64 validation passes the rebuilt DataField source and seven-check wide selection regression.

TextField selection export bounds (2026-10-24)
===============================================

- Treat zero or negative `mblen` results as conversion failure in narrow TextField selection export, preventing non-progressing loops and unsigned length underflow. Check wide selection lengths before multiplying by `sizeof(wchar_t)`.
- Preserve valid narrow/wide selection contents, ownership, public interfaces and native ABI. Extend the selection timestamp regression to cover both export formats and document the contract in `docs/textfield-selection-export-bounds.md`.
- Native AArch64 validation passes the rebuilt TextField source and eight-case selection/timestamp regression.

Text preedit recovery conversion bounds (2026-10-24)
=====================================================

- Validate every `mblen` step while recovering overstrike preedit text in the Text widget, preventing invalid pointer movement and append lengths for malformed locale sequences.
- Preserve valid composition behavior, callbacks, public interfaces and native ABI. Document the recovery contract in `docs/text-preedit-recovery-bounds.md`.
- Native AArch64 validation passes the warning-enabled Text source build.

Text preedit completion conversion bounds (2026-10-24)
=======================================================

- Validate every `mblen` result while completing overstrike preedit text, preventing negative byte counts and invalid source offsets on malformed locale sequences. Invalid recovery fragments now complete as empty text.
- Preserve valid preedit completion, callbacks, public interfaces and native ABI. Document the behavior in `docs/text-preedit-done-bounds.md`.
- Native AArch64 validation passes the warning-enabled Text source build.

DataField printable-text conversion progress (2026-10-24)
===========================================================

- Reject zero-length `mblen` results as well as negative results in both DataField printable-text validation loops, guaranteeing progress and preventing hangs on NUL or malformed locale input.
- Preserve valid printable/wide-character behavior, public interfaces and native ABI. Document the progress contract in `docs/datafield-printable-progress.md`.
- Native AArch64 validation passes the warning-enabled DataField build and Xvfb DataField regression.
