MakeIconPixmap now returns `None` for a missing source pixmap or zero-sized
source image before creating destination resources or issuing copy requests.

Bound MWM icon destination dimensions (2026-10-26)
---------------------------------------------------
MakeIconPixmap now rejects zero or overflow-prone configured maximum icon
dimensions before adding shadow and slab margins in unsigned arithmetic.

Guard MWM feedback-window lifecycle inputs (2026-10-26)
