Guard MWM system-modal cursor resources (2026-10-26)
-----------------------------------------------------
SetupSystemModalState now creates the no-enter cursor only when both bitmap
resources succeed; otherwise the modal input window uses the default cursor.

Guard MWM modal-window mapping failure (2026-10-26)
---------------------------------------------------
SetupSystemModalState now maps a modal input window only when XCreateWindow
