Reject impossible MWM title widths (2026-10-26)
-----------------------------------------------
GetFramePartInfo now rejects title and title-bar geometry when borders and
decorations consume the entire frame width, preventing unsigned width
underflow from producing a giant bogus title rectangle.

Bound MWM system/minimize/maximize positions (2026-10-26)
-----------------------------------------------------------
GetFramePartInfo now rejects system-menu and button geometry that cannot fit
inside the frame width, preventing wrapped unsigned x-coordinate calculations.

Bound MWM resize-corner spans (2026-10-26)
-------------------------------------------
Resize geometry now clamps an impossible interior span to zero before the
corner calculations, preventing unsigned subtraction from wrapping on tiny
frames.

Bound MWM resize edge positions (2026-10-26)
---------------------------------------------
East and south resize geometry now rejects frames narrower or shorter than
their lower border before subtracting that border from the frame coordinate.

Bound MWM corner edge coordinates (2026-10-26)
-----------------------------------------------
Northeast and southeast resize geometry now clamps corner coordinates when a
computed corner span exceeds the frame dimension, preventing unsigned wrap.

Bound MWM southwest edge coordinate (2026-10-26)
--------------------------------------------------
Southwest resize geometry now clamps its vertical corner coordinate when the
computed corner span exceeds the frame height.

Bound MWM resize corner spans (2026-10-26)
------------------------------------------
Resize corner widths and heights now cap at the frame dimensions, preventing
off-frame rectangles when a tiny frame is smaller than its configured corner.

